  "descriptionHtml": "<div class=\"product-description\">\n  <p class=\"product-summary\">This bag is made of our new innovative material, UpcraftedLeather. It is not leather, instead it’s made with at least 50% leather fibers, entangled through a recycled textile mesh, retanned and then finished for texture and durability. Moving easily from work to weekend, Dakota is an organized crossbody for every day. The compact design has room for a phone, wallet and more, plus pockets inside and out for easy organization. Crafted of our Signature UpcraftedLeather and buffalo-embossed leather, the versatile zip-top style is finished with two detachable straps to carry by hand or wear crossbody.</p>\n  \n  <div class=\"product-highlights\">\n    <h4>Product Specifications</h4>\n    <ul>\n      <li><strong>Material:</strong> Dakota Crossbody Bag In Signature UpcraftedLeather</li>\n      <li><strong>Lining:</strong> Fabric / Polyester</li>\n      <li><strong>Closure:</strong> Zip closure</li>\n      <li><strong>Organization:</strong> Inside snap pocket</li>\n    </ul>\n  </div>\n\n  <details class=\"size-guide-accordion\" style=\"margin-top: 15px; border: 1px solid #e5e5e5; border-radius: 6px; padding: 10px;\">\n    <summary style=\"font-weight: bold; cursor: pointer;\">📏 Size & Measurement Guide</summary>\n    <table style=\"width: 100%; margin-top: 10px; border-collapse: collapse; font-size: 14px;\">\n      <tbody>\n        <tr style=\"border-bottom: 1px solid #f0f0f0;\">\n          <td style=\"padding: 6px; font-weight: 600;\">Dimensions (L x H x W)</td>\n          <td style=\"padding: 6px;\">9.5&quot; (L) x 7.0&quot; (H) x 3.0&quot; (W)</td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr style=\"border-bottom: 1px solid #f0f0f0;\">\n          <td style=\"padding: 6px; font-weight: 600;\">Handle Drop</td>\n          <td style=\"padding: 6px;\">Detachable handle with 7.5&quot; drop</td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr>\n          <td style=\"padding: 6px; font-weight: 600;\">Shoulder / Crossbody Strap Drop</td>\n          <td style=\"padding: 6px;\">Detachable strap with 22&quot; drop for shoulder or crossbody wear</td>\n        </tr>\n      </tbody>\n    </table>\n  </details>\n</div>",
